    "updated_at": "2026-11-23T09:54:24Z",
    "body": "Correction of the \"After the #3453 PR\" table. The #3453 PR changed its method. The tab layout now stays as on origin/main. The untabbed levels of a tabbed loop start at window 0 of the tabbed levels.\n\nNew readings, PLANAR links, Arc lead r3:\n\n| level | window | entry XY | plunge Z | floor under centre | disc floor | below disc floor | crescent |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| -18 | 0 | (46.000, 8.865) | 2 -> -18 | -15.3 | -15.3 | 2.7 | 0 |\n| -18 | 1 | (10.153, -6.000) | 12 -> -18 | -15.3 | 0 | 18.0 | 2.501 |\n| -18 | 2 | (-6.000, 29.525) | 12 -> -18 | -15.3 | 0 | 18.0 | 2.501 |\n| -18 | 3 | (21.000, 30.029) | 12 -> -18 | -15.3 | 0 | 18.0 | 2.501 |\n\nStay-down ramp preset: window 0 plunges 2 -> -18 at (46.000, 8.865). The disc floor is -4.5 (13.5 mm below), with a 2.501 mm crescent. Windows 1 to 3 are as in the table.\n\nNo window dive has the full disc in uncut stock now. The \"full disc\" rows in the body are not valid.\n",
